The contract contains a critical vulnerability in its admin update mechanism that allows any user to gain administrative privileges.

### Vulnerability: Arbitrary update
### Explanation: The update_admin function lacks authorization checks, allowing any caller to update the admin address by providing a new address as the second application argument in an UpdateApplication call. This completely bypasses administrative controls.
### Risk: Critical - Allows complete takeover of the contract by any malicious actor
